<title>SPAIN:  Spain 3-yr note yield up, 10-yr down at auction.</title>
<headline>Spain 3-yr note yield up, 10-yr down at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Tuesday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE   Yield   Pvs     Price   Pvs     Bid	Allocated</p>
<p> 3-year 5.226   5.164   96.65   105.20  471.634  189.434</p>
<p>10-year 6.422   6.599   93.70   106.80  458.818  299.418</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
